<title>ISRAEL: Discount Investments Q4 net down.</title>
<headline>Discount Investments Q4 net down.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Discount Investments Ltd.</p>
<p>			   (in millons of shekels)</p>
<p>				 Q4 96   Q4 95  12-MTH 96  12-MTH 95</p>
<p>Attributable Earnings    38	40     168	   174</p>
<p>from affiliated companies</p>
<p>Capital gains	  loss 3	11	11	    11</p>
<p>Net Profit		   28	42     138	   160</p>
<p>The company declared an additional dividend of 20 million shekels, bringing its total dividend for 1996 to 35 million shekels compared with 33 million in 1995.</p>
<p>The company's board said it planned to issue bonus shares at a rate of two new shares for every one existing share. Shareholders will be asked to vote on this at the next general meeting.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.37 shekels)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
